  "description": "<h2 data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"116\">Brand introduction</h2>\r\n<p data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"140\">Zoovee is a direct-to-consumer furniture brand on a mission to make stylish, high-quality seating accessible to every home. With a focus on modular design and space-saving innovation, Zoovee delivers modern sofas and chairs that arrive right to your door&mdash;compressed for easy shipping and ready for rapid, tool-free setup.&nbsp;<span data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"525\" data-start=\"501\">Product description</h2>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"526\">\r\n<li data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"526\">\r\n<p data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"528\"><strong data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"528\">Modular Sofa</strong><br data-end=\"547\" data-start=\"544\">A fully configurable sofa system that adapts to any room or occasion. Mix and match modules to craft loveseats, sectionals, or chaise lounges in minutes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"743\">\r\n<p data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"745\"><strong data-end=\"763\" data-start=\"745\">Bean Bag Chair</strong><br data-end=\"766\" data-start=\"763\">A luxe, molded-foam chair that combines the cozy sink-in feel of a bean bag with durable, supportive memory foam&mdash;ideal for game rooms or reading nooks. <a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zoovee.co/\"></a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"960\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"962\"><strong data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"962\">Classic Bean Bag</strong><br data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"982\">A timeless, over-stuffed seat that expands to full size in seconds&mdash;perfect for casual lounging or extra guest seating.&nbsp;<span data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1146\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1363\" data-start=\"1148\"><strong data-end=\"1180\" data-start=\"1148\">Foldable Accent Lounge Chair</strong><br data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1180\">A sleek, space-saving chair that folds flat for storage or transport, then unfolds into a comfortable floor lounger&mdash;your &ldquo;seat, your way.&rdquo;&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1365\">Unique Selling Point</h2>\r\n<p data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1397\">Zoovee&rsquo;s hallmark is its <strong data-end=\"1457\" data-start=\"1422\">compressed-furniture technology</strong>: each piece ships vacuum-packed in compact boxes for lower shipping costs and minimal packaging waste. Once unpacked, products self-inflate or assemble in under five minutes&mdash;no tools required. Combined with fully modular designs and a broad palette of colors and fabrics, Zoovee offers truly <strong data-end=\"1788\" data-start=\"1750\">customizable, eco-friendly seating</strong> that fits both small apartments and spacious living rooms alike.</p>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1397\">Payment terms</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"0\">\r\n<p data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"2\">Commissions are calculated on all qualifying referrals from the <strong data-end=\"93\" data-start=\"66\">previous calendar month</strong> and paid out <strong data-end=\"125\" data-start=\"107\">once per month</strong> <span data-state=\"closed\"><a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://medium.com/%40prodmartbd/how-often-are-commissions-paid-unveiling-the-secrets-of-payment-frequency-in-affiliate-programs-6fad65f34ad9?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">Medium</a></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"166\">\r\n<p data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"168\"><strong data-end=\"223\" data-start=\"168\">Payouts are issued within the first 5 business days</strong> of each month for the prior month&rsquo;s earnings <a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://themify.me/affiliates?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">Themify</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"309\">\r\n<p data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"311\">&ldquo;Business days&rdquo; exclude weekends and observed holidays; if a scheduled payout date falls on a non-business day, payment will be processed on the <strong data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"456\">next</strong> business day</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
